{
 "id": "a04",
 "error_class": "equilibrium",
 "expected_check": "equilibrium",
 "assigned_role": "mechanical",
 "description": "mechanical.gearboxes reaction_moment is 40.8 kgf*cm, the output torque divided over the two gearboxes ([R1.07] * [R2.17] / [R2.26]). But torque_peak on the same node is already the torque of one gearbox, 81.5 kgf*cm. The housing reaction of each gearbox must balance its own output torque, so reaction_moment should be 81.5 kgf*cm. As written, the moments on each gearbox leave a residual of 40.7 kgf*cm (about 3.99 N*m).",
